<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Horta Uni Flat</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header class="top-header">
        <div class="header-content">
            <div class="header-text">
                <h1>cultivando campo e cidade</h1>
                <h2>compartilhando conhecimento</h2>
                <h2>e amizade</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="search-box">
                <input type="text" placeholder="pesquisa">
                <p>poder digitar</p>
                <p>aparece teclado</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <nav class="main-nav">
        <ul>
            <li class="nav-item">
                <span class="nav-title">cursos <span class="arrow">v</span></span>
                <div class="dropdown-content">
                    <p>como plantar verdura</p>
                    <p>como molhar corretamente</p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
                <span class="nav-title">inovação <span class="arrow">v</span></span>
                <div class="dropdown-content">
                    <p>mansaço em cano de pvc</p>
                    <p>alocação florida em latas de terra</p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
                <span class="nav-title">linha verde <span class="arrow">v</span></span>
                <div class="dropdown-content">
                    <p>aparece 2 linhas</p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
                <span class="nav-title">tópicos <span class="arrow">v</span></span>
                <div class="dropdown-content">
                    <p>hortaliças</p>
                    <p>verduras</p>
                </div>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <main class="call-to-action-section">
        <div class="call-to-action-box">
            <p>Para ter uma experiência incrível</p>
            <button id="clickMeButton">clique aqui!</button>
            <ul>
                <li>o semento</li>
                <li>dicas</li>
                <li>cuidados</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </main>

    <section class="main-content-grid">
        <div class="grid-row">
            <div class="grid-item content-label" id="sementes-label">
                <h3>Sementes</h3>
                <div class="hidden-content" id="sementes-details">
                    <p>quando clica</p>
                    <p>vai aparecer 2 tipos de sementes:</p>
                    <p>Semente A (Ex: Tomate)</p>
                    <p>Semente B (Ex: Alface)</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item plant-representation">
                <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item plant-representation">
                <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item right-column-text">
                <h3>Como fazer sua horta em espaço pequeno</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>o pegue um cano de PVC</li>
                    <li>faça buracos...</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-row">
            <div class="grid-item content-label">
                <h3>cultivos</h3>
                <p>como plantar a verdura</p>
                <p>como colher a verdura</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item plant-representation">
                 <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item plant-representation">
                 <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item right-column-text">
                <h3>como fazer horta em espaço grande</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>faça canteiros</li>
                    <li>faça burraco grande...</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-row">
            <div class="grid-item content-label">
                <h3>Adultos orgânicos</h3>
                <p>como fazer com resto de comida</p>
                <p>fezes de animais</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item plant-representation">
                 <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item plant-representation">
                 <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item right-column-text">
                <h3>Dicas de como começar a fazer a horta</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>prepare o solo com adulto</li>
                    <li>e plante verduras próximos uns os outros</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-row last-row">
            <div class="grid-item content-label">
                <h3>Verduras</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item plant-representation">
                 <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item plant-representation">
                 <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="plant-row">
                    <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item right-column-text">
                <h3>hortaliças</h3>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>